        <mxCell id="legend" value="All AWS-service traffic from VPC Lambdas flows through PrivateLink VPC endpoints (dashed purple) — no NAT gateway, no public egress. DB credentials fetched from Secrets Manager at cold start. Data layer (PostgreSQL + pgvector) is portable to Outposts / sovereign infrastructure." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
